<div style="font-family: Garamond, Georgia, serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 24px;">

  <p style="font-size: 1rem;">Hi <%= @report_download.name %>,</p>

  <p style="font-size: 1rem;">Thank you for your interest. Please find your copy of the <strong><%= @compensation_report.name %></strong> compensation report attached.</p>

  <!-- Report card -->
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 32px; margin: 28px 0; background: #fafafa;">

    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.01em;">
      <%= @compensation_report.name %>
    </h2>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 1rem; color: #555;">
      <%= @compensation_report.location %>
    </p>

    <div style="border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-top: 18px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #2a2a2a; line-height: 1.7;">
      These are observed market averages and do not include outliers. If you'd like to discuss the data in more detail or explore like-for-like metrics tailored to your exact role, feel free to reach out for a confidential chat.
    </div>

  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 28px;">
    Please don't hesitate to get in touch if you have any questions.
  </p>

  <p style="margin-top: 32px; font-size: 1rem;">
    Best regards,<br>
    Laurenz Gerold<br>
    <span style="color: #555;">Gerold &amp; Partners</span><br>
    <span style="color: #555;">+44 7456 252 602</span>
  </p>

</div>
